#. type: Title =
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/benefits-of-node.adoc:1
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/benefits-of-node.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benefits of establishing a node"
msgstr "建立節點的好處"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/benefits-of-node.adoc:5
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/benefits-of-node.adoc:5
msgid "Establishing a node is one of the key commitments that Participants make in joining GBIF.  It is important to understand the roles that nodes play within GBIF, as well as the benefits that nodes provide on the national level."
msgstr "建立節點是參與者加入 GBIF 時所作出的關鍵承諾之一。了解節點在 GBIF 內所扮演的角色，以及節點在國家層面所帶來的益處，至關重要。"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/benefits-of-node.adoc:6
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/benefits-of-node.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why are Participant nodes needed?"
msgstr "為什麼需要參與者節點？"

